OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start this morning, with
OL,6,Frain turning heavy at times and
OL,7,Faccompanied by brisk winds. Rain and
OL,8,Fwinds quickly easing with sunny skies
OL,9,Ffor many by mid-morning. A few showers
OL,10,Fthen developing during the afternoon.
OL,11,FWarm in the sunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA mix of clear spells and a
OL,14,Fscattering of showers this evening.
OL,15,FThe showers becoming mainly confined
OL,16,Fto northern and western areas
OL,17,Fovernight. A cooler night than last
OL,18,Fnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
