OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA largely dry and bright day
OL,6,Ffor many with sunny spells. A few
OL,7,Fshowers will develop, especially near
OL,8,FIrish Sea coasts. Temperatures nearer
OL,9,Faverage.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,12,Freturns on Friday, potentially heavy
OL,13,Ffor a time. A risk of some further
OL,14,Frain on Saturday before turning drier
OL,15,Fand brighter on Sunday. Temperatures
OL,16,Faround average for early October.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
